title: "AI Engineering Playbook"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source, beginner-to-intermediate guide to AI engineering in 2027: coding agents,
  AI agents with LangGraph, guardrails, LLM security (OWASP LLM Top 10), evaluation, agent memory,
  production operations and AI system design, with five hands-on projects.
